- ACTION: Employment — Category: the speaker working for the player as a retainer or hold steward: hire the speaker to run a venture off-screen; appoint or relieve a hold steward; pay back-wages, grant a raise or settle on a compromise; grant, refuse or forgive a loan; hear out or brush off a work grievance; hand over earnings or the hold vault; or let a retainer go. Only when one of these is settled in this exchange; open offers and plans for later are words. Money between the player and their own worker is here, not Economy. Not the speaker's job for someone else, a traveling companion (Companionship), or a whole outlaw camp (OutlawCamp).
