action":"","narrative_note":"The frantic academic research has given way to sudden physical exertion and a hasty relocation, leaving a lingering sense of urgency despite the current stillness.","phase":"RisingAction","t":1792292180.6550398,"tension_score":30},{"action":"","narrative_note":"The high-stakes academic tension has resolved into low-stakes social interaction as Maxxor seeks mundane respite in the bathhouse.","phase":"RisingAction","t":1792292278.2440186,"tension_score":25},{"action":"","narrative_note":"The casual atmosphere shatters as Maxxor's sudden physical distress draws urgent concern from Ithrini and Solveig, turning a quiet moment into active suspense.","phase":"RisingAction","t":1792292399.361015,"tension_score":65}]
