- **SFX (inline, glued to onomatopoeia):** `[sfx-cough]`,`[sfx-laughter]`,`[sfx-crying]`,`[sfx-screaming]`,`[sfx-burping]`,`[sfx-humming]`,`[sfx-sigh]`,`[sfx-sniff]`,`[sfx-sneeze]`,
