- [9:59 AM, Sundas] (npc_thoughts) Ithrini Oreyn: He's fully naked and I'm clinging to him, but I don't mind. Glad he's not actually hurt.
- [9:59 AM, Sundas] (dialogue) Ithrini Oreyn to Maxxor: Oh, thank the Three. I thought you were about to drop right there on the tiles.
